<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 3-month T-bill yield drops to 22.50 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary 3-month T-bill yield drops to 22.50 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on the latest issue of three-month discount treasury bills was set by auction at 22.50 percent, down from 22.52 percent at an auction one week ago, the Government Debt Management Agency said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	     5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received	9,228.72 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	    5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		 5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    22.50 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		     94.7437 pct</p>
</text>
